  "id": "introspective-method",
  "term": "introspective method",
  "definition": "The introspective method is the systematic use of self-observation to study mental experience for scientific purposes. In psychology it has been treated as a basic method, often used alongside experimental conditions and supplemented by inference and observation of mental activity as shown in others.",
